  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of the National Fund for Climate &amp; Environment (FONERWA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To help the Government of Rwanda achieve low carbon, climate resilient growth by providing technical assistance to help them manage FONERWA &#x2013; a national fund for environment and climate change. This will help build national capacity for managing the fund by September 2015 and ensure that contributions to the fund are well-spent.</narrative>
  </description>
